# VMS-41R1 immutable calibration-pack regression checklist

- [ ] Frozen pack replays all 19 scenarios and every evidence axis without mismatch.
- [ ] Calibration remains DEVELOPMENT_ONLY and cannot qualify a model or authorize live work.
- [ ] Fine and direct occurrence histories are distinct inputs with the same valid projection.
- [ ] Member tampering, extra files and symlinks fail closed.
- [ ] A changed expected verdict becomes a recorded mismatch, never learned automatically.
- [ ] Mutation DSL rejects add, missing targets, noncanonical indices, root and append pointers.
- [ ] Runner imports no model, Solver, DB, network or subprocess client.
